### Reconnaissance Settings Api Tests

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@scheduleId = 3a336a89-4279-4243-9d1d-6da5c432a7a6

### ===== GET RECONNAISSANCE SETTINGS =====
### Retrieve reconnaissance settings for a schedule (404 if not set)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/reconnaissance
Accept: application/json

### ===== SAVE (CREATE/UPDATE) RECONNAISSANCE SETTINGS =====
### Create or update reconnaissance settings for a schedule
### Note: Schedule must have ScheduleType = "Reconnaissance"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/reconnaissance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-26T06:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 1,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true
}

### ===== UPDATE SETTINGS (same endpoint) =====
PUT {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/reconnaissance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-26T07:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T09:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T23:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 10,
  "minSpyCount": 2,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 10000,
  "skipNightSendings": false
}

### ===== TEST VALIDATIONS =====

### Invalid schedule type (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/schedules/INVALID-SCHEDULE-ID/reconnaissance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-26T06:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 1,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true
}

### Invalid time order (MinArrivalTime before MinDepartureTime)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/reconnaissance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-26T10:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 1,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true
}

### Invalid spy count (< 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/reconnaissance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-26T06:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-26T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 0,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true
}

### INSTRUCTIONS:
### 1. First, create a schedule with ScheduleType = "Reconnaissance"
### 2. Use that schedule's ID in {{scheduleId}}
### 3. PUT creates settings if they don't exist, updates if they do
### 4. GET returns 404 if settings haven't been set yet
### 5. DELETE schedule will cascade delete these settings

### Response includes:
### - id, scheduleId
### - minDepartureTime, minArrivalTime, maxArrivalTime (ISO 8601 with timezone)
### - minDistanceToFront, minSpyCount, maxPopulationInSourceVillage
### - skipNightSendings (boolean)
